.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits
.Ql "0"
if exiting without error.
Otherwise the exit status will be
.Ql "1" .
.
.Sh EXAMPLES
The following examples all assume that the user’s session ID
has been saved as described in CONFIGURATION above.
.Pp
Submit the answer
.Ql "12345"
for day 1 of year 2025:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ sled answer --year 2025 --day 1 --part 1 12345
.Ed
.Pp
View the calendar for year 2025:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ sled calendar --year 2025
.Ed
.Pp
Download the puzzle for day 1 of year 2025:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ sled puzzle --year 2025 --day 1
.Ed
.
